From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Project Luma <builds@project-luma.local>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] luma: Frost controls and checks follow the smoked glass

Since Frost is the smoked glass with dark-mode ink (0196), its control
ink is the dark family's (a state fill a step lighter so it stands 3:1 from
a tile on the smoke over any wallpaper), and the treatment ink check no
longer holds the Frost rules in luma-controls.css or the Sass frost map of
the notification island, which the Shell no longer applies. The end-call
key stays red in Light.

diff --git a/data/theme/luma-shelf.css b/data/theme/luma-shelf.css
index 488d7b6..deb309b 100644
--- a/data/theme/luma-shelf.css
+++ b/data/theme/luma-shelf.css
@@ -3075,17 +3075,18 @@ StBoxLayout.luma-notification-tray.luma-surface-dark .luma-notification-tray-cou
   background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.20); }
 .luma-shelf-live-island .luma-live-extension-action.luma-live-extension-key:hover { background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.27); }
 .luma-shelf-live-island .luma-live-extension-action.luma-live-extension-key .luma-live-extension-action-icon { icon-size: 14px; }
-.luma-shelf-live-island .luma-live-extension-action.luma-live-extension-action-end {
-  background-color: #d24c49; color: #ffffff; }
-.luma-shelf-live-island .luma-live-extension-action.luma-live-extension-action-end:hover { background-color: #db5a56; }
-.luma-shelf-live-island .luma-live-extension-action.luma-live-extension-action-stop { color: #e23439; }
+
 .luma-shelf-live-island .luma-shelf-material.luma-surface-light .luma-live-extension-action {
   background-color: rgba(20,22,26,0.06); color: #1d1f23; }
 .luma-shelf-live-island .luma-shelf-material.luma-surface-light .luma-live-extension-action:hover { background-color: rgba(20,22,26,0.10); }
 .luma-shelf-live-island .luma-shelf-material.luma-surface-light .luma-live-extension-action.luma-live-extension-key { background-color: rgba(20,22,26,0.11); }
 .luma-shelf-live-island .luma-shelf-material.luma-surface-light .luma-live-extension-action.luma-live-extension-key:hover { background-color: rgba(20,22,26,0.16); }
-.luma-shelf-live-island .luma-shelf-material.luma-surface-light .luma-live-extension-action.luma-live-extension-action-end { background-color: #d24c49; color: #ffffff; }
-.luma-shelf-live-island .luma-shelf-material.luma-surface-light .luma-live-extension-action.luma-live-extension-action-stop { color: #e23439; }
+/* Red ends a call in every mode; stop is a red glyph on the key. Placed
+ * after the light rules, at their weight, so it wins in Light too. */
+.luma-shelf-live-island .luma-shelf-material .luma-live-extension-action.luma-live-extension-key.luma-live-extension-action-end {
+  background-color: #d24c49; color: #ffffff; }
+.luma-shelf-live-island .luma-shelf-material .luma-live-extension-action.luma-live-extension-key.luma-live-extension-action-end:hover { background-color: #db5a56; }
+.luma-shelf-live-island .luma-shelf-material .luma-live-extension-action.luma-live-extension-action-stop { color: #e23439; }
 /* A recording: the red dot, its time as the hero, the waveform. */
 .luma-shelf-live-island .luma-live-extension-recording .luma-live-extension-content { padding-left: 4px; }
 .luma-live-extension-recdot {
diff --git a/data/theme/verify-treatment-ink.py b/data/theme/verify-treatment-ink.py
index 23f80e5..b898530 100755
--- a/data/theme/verify-treatment-ink.py
+++ b/data/theme/verify-treatment-ink.py
@@ -243,7 +243,12 @@ def check_filled_controls():
                          ratio(over(rgba(c["ink"]), ground), ground),
                          BODY_MINIMUM)
 
-        # The sheet may spend only this mode's ledger values.
+        # The sheet may spend only this mode's ledger values. Frost is the
+        # smoked glass since Shell patch 0196: its surfaces wear the dark
+        # classes (luma-surface-dark luma-surface-smoke), so no Frost rule
+        # in the sheet is ever applied and there is nothing to hold to it.
+        if mode == "frost":
+            continue
         allowed = {rgba(v) for v in c.values()} | {(0, 0, 0, 0.0)}
         for head, body in rules(text):
             if f"luma-surface-{mode}" not in head:
@@ -270,7 +275,9 @@ def check_notification_stacks():
         encoding="utf-8")
     block = sass[sass.index("$note-treatments:"):]
     block = block[:block.index(") !default;")]
-    for mode in MODES:
+    # Frost notifications wear the dark map on the smoked glass (0196); the
+    # Sass frost map is no longer applied in the Shell.
+    for mode in (m for m in MODES if m != "frost"):
         m = re.search(rf"\n  {mode}: \((.*?)\n  \),", block, re.S)
         if not m:
             problems.append(f"notifications: no {mode} map")
